<Text>PARAMS: none — run directly.&#xD;REPORTS: via Agentic-fm Debug → agent/debug/output.json&#xD;FIXTURES: 2 Dobavljaci ("Inter Cars TEST-&lt;tag&gt;", "TEST-NoTemplate-&lt;tag&gt;") + 2 Primke; lines created by the workers under test. All deleted in teardown.&#xD;SAFE FOR: dev servers only.</Text>
